# Line endings for this deploy layer. Citadel runs these files on Linux, so they
# stay LF on every checkout, Windows included; PowerShell and batch files stay CRLF.
# Squire writes this file only when the folder has none, and never over your own.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
